sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant GUI as GUI - React
    participant Runner as Runner
    participant Adapter as AgentAdapter
    participant Bridge as bridge.rs
    participant Broadcast as tokio broadcast
    participant CP as Control Plane

    User->>GUI: Type prompt
    GUI->>Runner: POST /v1/sessions/id/commands\nsend_prompt + content
    Runner->>Adapter: send_message(session_id, prompt)

    Note over Adapter: Adapter calls native engine\nClaude / Roo / Codex in-process

    loop For each agent event
        Adapter-->>Runner: mpsc Receiver of UnifiedAgentEvent

        Runner->>Bridge: unified_event_to_runtime_detail(event)
        Bridge-->>Runner: Option of RuntimeEventDetail

        alt Detail is Some
            Runner->>Broadcast: publish_stream_event(json_line)
            Runner->>CP: POST /v1/sessions/id/events\nRuntimeEventDetail
        else Detail is None - lifecycle
            Note over Runner: Skip broadcast for lifecycle events
        end

        Broadcast-->>GUI: WebSocket SSE runtime event JSON
    end

    Note over GUI: RemoteApp.tsx renders\nTimelineCard per event